        "original_id": "848c451c-4235-5f7c-9e73-88ddd9c5d0a7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luke Rockhold, Chris Weidman, Anderson Silva\n- Organizations: UFC\n- Roles: Middleweight Champion\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Chris Weidman became the first man to defeat Anderson Silva inside the UFC and became the Middleweight Champion.\n- Chris Weidman held the Middleweight Champion title for approximately two and a half years.\n- On December 12, 2015, Luke Rockhold won the title by defeating prior champion Chris Weidman via fourth-round TKO.\n- At the time Luke Rockhold won the title, Chris Weidman had been undefeated.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
